<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view>
      <view class="app-name">简单记分</view>
      <view class="tagline">多人活动记分工具</view>
    </view>
    <view class="badge">最多 12 人</view>
  </view>

  <view class="action-panel">
    <button class="primary-button" bindtap="goCreate">创建房间</button>
    <button class="secondary-button" bindtap="goJoin">输入房间码</button>
    <button class="ghost-button" bindtap="scanJoin">扫码加入</button>
  </view>

  <view class="dev-panel" wx:if="{{isLocalBackend}}">
    <view class="dev-title">开发测试身份</view>
    <view class="dev-current">当前：{{localMockOpenid}}</view>
    <view class="dev-users">
      <button
        wx:for="{{localMockUsers}}"
        wx:key="*this"
        class="dev-user-button {{item === localMockOpenid ? 'active' : ''}}"
        data-openid="{{item}}"
        bindtap="switchLocalMockUser"
      >
        {{item}}
      </button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section" wx:if="{{recentRooms.length}}">
    <view class="section-title">最近进入</view>
    <view
      class="recent-item"
      wx:for="{{recentRooms}}"
      wx:key="roomId"
      bindtap="goRoom"
      data-room-id="{{item.roomId}}"
    >
      <view>
        <view class="recent-name">{{item.name}}</view>
        <view class="recent-code">房间码 {{item.roomCode}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="recent-arrow">进入</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="notice">
    适用于聚会小游戏、桌游、亲子任务和团队活动，快速创建房间并记录积分变化。
  </view>
</view>
